# The tool as its users meet it. Read by "blueprint usecase".
name Blueprint
system Blueprint

actor DEV : Developer
actor ARCH : Designer
actor CI : Build pipeline

case UC1 : Extract a model from C++ source
case UC2 : Emit a class diagram
case UC3 : Generate a relational schema
case UC4 : Generate class skeletons from a schema
case UC5 : Read a diagram back into a model
case UC6 : Report the drift between diagram and code
case UC7 : Choose the inheritance strategy

DEV -> UC1
DEV -> UC2
DEV -> UC3
DEV -> UC4
ARCH -> UC2
ARCH -> UC5
ARCH -> UC6
CI -> UC6

UC2 -> UC1 : include
UC3 -> UC1 : include
UC6 -> UC1 : include
UC6 -> UC5 : include
UC7 -> UC3 : extend
